constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(N)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def getSubstringWithEqual012(self, Str):
		n = len(Str)
		hash_map = {(0, 0): 1}
		count = [0, 0, 0]
		result = 0
		for i in range(n):
			count[int(Str[i])] += 1
			temp = (count[0] - count[1], count[1] - count[2])
			if temp in hash_map:
				result += hash_map[temp]
				hash_map[temp] += 1
			else:
				hash_map[temp] = 1
		return result
